    Collaboration tools: direct calls, not inside `functions.exec`. Shared filesystem and working directory....less stopped or shut down. Do not poll for completion [hash=76b09020695c57df]
    `wait_agent`: waits of minutes preferred over busy polling

    Active-agent limit, including you: 4

    `model` or `reasoning_effort`: only when explicitly requested by the user, AGENTS.md, or skills. Overrid...Omitted or `"all"`: parent model and effort inherited [hash=d4c4ef044a7cfe99]

